{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humans had the silly idea of bringing dinosaurs back to life, and ever since, relationships between the two species have been strained. No dinosaurs wanted to become a cop, so you were created in a laboratory to become the only dinosaur cop. Every day, you ask yourself: are you making the world better for your dino peers, or are you just a tool of human propaganda? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rich and funny story starring a dozen anthropomorphic dinosaurs, and other silly characters, entangled in personal drama and sociopolitical issues about the realities of dino life in a human world ;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sniff out crimes thanks to your magnifying glass, your literal nose and other tools that will let you interact with your environment in clever ways ;\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep track of your investigation using an elaborated node system and a timetable ;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About 10 hours of gameplay<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187010/extras/e1d33d1a50a4f90f1ca20c5c748b6e49.avif?t=1759267677\" width=1200 height=453 /></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3187010?t=1759267677","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187010/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759267677","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187010/b315af74ae2a7b14cd5caeae2f2238553777cc4b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759267677","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187010/b315af74ae2a7b14cd5caeae2f2238553777cc4b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759267677","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The mature content in this game primarily consists of cartoon violence. Dialogues include swearing and cursing, while some characters use drugs, alcohol, and tobacco, and commit crimes."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3261900,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humans had the silly idea of bringing dinosaurs back to life, and ever since, relationships between the two species have been strained. No dinosaurs wanted to become a cop, so you were created in a laboratory to become the only dinosaur cop. Every day, you ask yourself: are you making the world better for your dino peers, or are you just a tool of human propaganda? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rich and funny story starring a dozen anthropomorphic dinosaurs, and other silly characters, entangled in personal drama and sociopolitical issues about the realities of dino life in a human world ;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sniff out crimes thanks to your magnifying glass, your literal nose and other tools that will let you interact with your environment in clever ways ;\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep track of your investigation using an elaborated node system and a timetable ;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About 10 hours of gameplay<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187010/extras/e1d33d1a50a4f90f1ca20c5c748b6e49.avif?t=1759267677\" width=1200 height=453 /></span></p></li></ul>","developers":["Pieces Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187010/7d9461adc223e23077339bc21405